<title>CANADA: CBRS puts Cambridge Shopping on watch list.</title>
<headline>CBRS puts Cambridge Shopping on watch list.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Bond Rating Service said on Monday it put Cambridge Shopping Centres Ltd on its credit watch list with developing implications.</p>
<p>The rating agency also said it maintained Markborough Properties Inc's ratings on its credit watch list with negative implications.</p>
